IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RECONCL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY BILLREC.
       COPY PAYREC.
       COPY RECONREC.
       01 WS-DIFFERENCE PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RC.
       RECONCILE.
           COMPUTE WS-DIFFERENCE = BILL-TOTAL - PAYMENT-AMOUNT
           IF WS-DIFFERENCE NOT = 0 MOVE 4 TO LK-RC ELSE MOVE 0 TO LK-RC END-IF
           GOBACK.
